/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 632 0 R
/T (      From a young anarchist inside San Vittore Prison: "The inspector from the fourth floor physically forced me to sit on the windowsill, with my legs dangling over the edge, and began to insult and hound me: "Jump! Why don't you jump? Not man enough? Finish it off! What are you waiting for?" I swear, i had to grit my teeth to keep from losing it, and jumping")
/E (      From a young anarchist inside San Vittore Prison: "The inspector from the fourth floor physically forced me to sit on the windowsill, with my legs dangling over the edge, and began to insult and hound me: "Jump! Why don't you jump? Not man enough? Finish it off! What are you waiting for?" I swear, i had to grit my teeth to keep from losing it, and jumping")
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
