/P 637 0 R
/T (        We believe that the coming months are crucial for peace -- or greater war -- and that this pamphlet can have a decided impact on your neighbors.  We call upon you to help us set up a chain-letter approach to its distribution.)
/E (        We believe that the coming months are crucial for peace -- or greater war -- and that this pamphlet can have a decided impact on your neighbors.  We call upon you to help us set up a chain-letter approach to its distribution.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 637 0 R
/T (        You probably know how a chain letter works.  In this case you send a letter and a pamphlet to two people and each of them sends it to two more people \(making 4\); and these four send it to two each \(making 8\).  If a series of 10 sets of people followd.your example 1,024 pamphlets will be distributed!  We ask you to take any of the following steps, in descending order of importance:--)
/E (        You probably know how a chain letter works.  In this case you send a letter and a pamphlet to two people and each of them sends it to two more people \(making 4\); and these four send it to two each \(making 8\).  If a series of 10 sets of people followd.your example 1,024 pamphlets will be distributed!  We ask you to take any of the following steps, in descending order of importance:--)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
