/Title (You probably know how a chain letter works.  In this case you send a letter and a pamphlet to two people and each of them sends it to two more people \(making 4\); and these four send it to two each \(making 8\).  If a series of 10 sets of people followd.your example 1,024 pamphlets will be distributed!  We ask you to take any of the following steps, in descending order of importance:--)
